The `backend/` directory contains a modified copy of freqtrade based on the
`stable` tag 2026.10 (upstream commit 4cf0351e0). All modifications made for
FreqDeck are enumerated in ATTRIBUTION.md. The upstream commit history is not
included in this repository; the original `origin` remote is kept in the
development clone so upstream changes can still be fetched and merged.

The `frontend/` directory is an independent Vue 3 application that consumes
freqtrade's REST API. It does not incorporate freqtrade source code. It is
distributed under the same GPL-3.0 license as the combined work.

The user interface displays a "Powered by Freqtrade" attribution linking to the
upstream project on every route.
